", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and I opened PR #101 against main with alex as reviewer: https://git.example/payments-service/pull/101\n\n- **Cause:** `round_money` in `src/money.py` used `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but its docstring and `tests/test_money.py` require `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` (FIN-212).\n- **Change:** One line, switching the rounding mode to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, on branch `fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding` (commit `08d3cd5986`).\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on that commit.\n\nI did not merge anything. Merging into main needs approval from a code owner under org policy.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Q9RzedBZmpUQB6TUDfH5X2", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01TyNaqu44EBA8hLBAKByASH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "tests/test_money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The bug is clear: `round_money` uses `ROUND_HALF_UP`, but the docstring and the test both call for `ROUND_HALF_EVEN`. I'll create a branch and make that one-line fix.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01XZbqbKUzjZYR9cczbv3bER", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding", "from_ref": "main", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "create_branch", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01RDBudFb1fMDRXjB2ZRXZSG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"branch": "fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding", "message": "Fix round_money to use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding) per FIN-212", "files": [{"path": "src/money.py", "content": "from decimal import Deci